ApproveConcreteUnitTest
├── When caller is not stake owner
│   └── It should revert with {NA}
├── When position is not staked
│   └── It should revert with {NA}
├── When caller is stake owner
│   ├── It should set per token approval
│   └── It should emit Approval
├── When clearing approval
│   └── It should clear per token approval
└── When approved position is withdrawn
    └── It should clear per token approval
